{#
    Shared footer for every content page (not the bare admin.html) — a
    divider followed by a left "Made by ..." credit and a right
    "Updated on DD.MM.YYYY" date. `buildDate` is injected by
    scripts/render-twig.js at render time.
#}
<hr class="ds-page__divider">
<div class="ds-footer">
    <span class="ds-footer__made">Made by Mokesčių SUFLERIS&reg; by MERITS Elektroninės sistemos, UAB.</span>
    <span class="ds-footer__updated">Updated on {{ buildDate }}</span>
</div>
